## ⚡ FIX: Iterative Stack‑Based Parser (No Recursion)

The architectural fix replaces all recursion with a manual `Vec` stack. The algorithm:

1. Walk tokens linearly
2. Read indentation from `Whitespace` tokens
3. Parse inline content (attributes, text) in a flat loop
4. Use a stack of `(indent, ASTNode)` to attach children to the correct parent
5. Pop stack when indentation decreases

**Plus:** Bump all element tokens to `priority = 4` so `p` is always `Paragraph`, never `AttrName`.

